% references.bib — semiotics theory
%
% Consolidated bibliography for the structural-semiotic synthesis: triadic
% sign-relation (Peirce), structural-systemic langue (Saussure), form-substance
% glossematics (Hjelmslev), structural semantics with semantic square
% (Greimas), encyclopedic bound on semiosis (Eco), semiosphere
% (Lotman), social-semiotic register/field/tenor/mode (Halliday),
% biosemiotic extension (Sebeok), and translation typology (Jakobson).

